          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "梅尔",
          "text": "我要——我要记下来。把这些情况记录一下。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "梅尔",
          "text": "Thermal-EX，我想让你帮我做一些实验，可以吗？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Thermal-EX",
          "text": "乐意之至，我亲爱的梅尔小姐！",
